warning[NK2123]: `spawn` is replaced by `async(detached)`, which starts the same task.
   --> tests/spawn_is_warned_with_its_edit.nika:11:5
    |
 11 |     let h = spawn fn { work(1) }
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: `spawn fn { … }` is the earlier spelling of `async(detached) fn { … }` (ADR-async-5 D13); it is removed once every use is rewritten.
    = help: Write `async(detached) fn { … }`, the same task; `nikaia fix --only NK2123` makes the edit.
